WEBVTT

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:04.590
This way.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.840
Can we get through here?

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.980
We'll camp here tonight.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.120
Green ones, grant me shelter for the night:

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.090
a bed of grass, a roof of trees, 
and tolerance for an unannounced guest.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.030
Wow!

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.620
It's no big deal.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.360
Um, did I do something wrong?

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.330
I wasn't raised in the best circumstances.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.070
I don't deal well with people who 
were brought up as well as you.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:52.560
But I'll repay my debt to 
you, and I'll do my job.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.460
I wasn't brought up <i>that</i> well.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.070
We'll reach the village by morning.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:02.160
Remember, I'm only leading you there.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.860
I won't be fighting demons 
by your side or anything.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.160
I know. That's fine.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:11.670
Shouldn't we keep watch?

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.430
The fairies will do it.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:15.780
They'll make noise to wake 
us if anything happens.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.690
Hey, why don't we chat for a bit?

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:21.260
I'm tired.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:23.050
If you wanna be awake, be awake on your own.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.730
<i>How long has it been since 
I began my travels?</i>

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:34.710
<i>This was my first night spent with 
someone else since my departure.</i>

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:46.160
The Faraway Paladin

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.710
Ruins?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.030
Used to be.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:14.360
The stones and stuff are 
pretty useful for building.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.660
The village is ahead.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.510
They're there.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:26.340
Yeah.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:28.810
I'll scout it out. Wait here.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:36.990
A ritual?

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:40.050
Yeah, at the ruins of the village temple.

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:42.200
Damn demons...

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.750
How's the temple laid out, 
and how are the demons organized?

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.590
About like this.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:52.290
There's no ceiling, and some 
of the walls have collapsed.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.000
They've formed a ring in the 
center to perform their ritual.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.370
There are two commanders.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:59.390
They have faces like lizards. 
I forget what they're called...

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:00.490
Vraskus?

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:02.640
Yeah, something like that.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.470
What else?

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:06.460
They have several soldiers 
patrolling outside the temple.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:09.110
I know there's, at least, 
one demon beast inside.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.770
What's the demon beast like?

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:14.370
It has a human-like head 
and a lion-like body,

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.060
and wings like a bat's.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.440
A manticore.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.930
You know a lot about these guys, huh?

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.090
I've studied them a fair bit.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:22.490
Still...

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.340
I'm glad it's no more than that.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.360
No more than that?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.610
Let's just go in head-on and crush them.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.440
Cadere Araneum!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.270
Falling Spiderweb

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.050
Currere!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:02.940
Run

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:03.690
Oleum!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:03.610
Oil

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.010
Acceleratio!

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:10.830
Accelerate

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.210
Vastare!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.160
Devastate

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.890
I thought you weren't going to fight.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.810
I just jumped in because I 
could tell you were winning.

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:30.380
There aren't many people who could 
tackle those guys alone and win.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.380
The conditions were in my favor.

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.680
Regardless, your strength is abnormal.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.770
Do you do some special 
training or something?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.780
Uh... I eat a lot of bread, I guess.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:42.340
Humans don't get stronger just from that.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:46.490
Well, anyway, I think we took care 
of the bulk of their forces.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.890
I guess all that's left is to 
clean up any surviving demons.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.770
I hope some of the villagers survived.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:52.800
Yeah.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.060
Oh, hang on a second.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:26.960
Bro...ther...

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.870
Brother Menel...

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:41.050
The demons... attacked the village.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.340
It was so hot...

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:46.510
But I stayed strong and 
didn't make any noise.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:50.480
Because... I had faith...

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.060
that you would come...

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.450
And you really did.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.670
Thank you.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:07.500
What... Why?

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.210
Huh? I...

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.220
H-Hey!

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.140
You did very well.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.500
Good job.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:20.010
Who are you?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.970
I'm a friend of Brother Menel's.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:24.070
I'm sorry.

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:27.230
He's a bit unsteady on his 
feet because he's very tired.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.120
Oh, okay.

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.910
That's it. Good boy.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:31.720
Here...

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.390
Menel.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.550
Sorry I showed up a little late.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:43.100
No, it's okay.

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:46.350
You must be tired. Go to sleep.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.680
You're... right.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.230
I feel... kind of sleepy...

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.870
Dream happy dreams.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:55.820
Okay.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.110
Gracefeel, Goddess of Light,

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.270
grant him peace and guidance.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:12.730
Hey...

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.630
What?

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.020
Sorry.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.410
For what?

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.900
I didn't take you seriously.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.820
I thought you were some rich 
boy with money and muscles

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.160
who happened to earn a god's 
divine protection and got cocky,

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.760
spouting nothing but useless platitudes.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.770
So... I'm sorry.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.020
I don't mind.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:38.180
<i>There was still a markedly 
pained look on his face,</i>

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:41.200
<i>but still, Menel smiled just a little bit.</i>

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:44.520
<i>He didn't hesitate any more after that.</i>

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.730
<i>He held the hands of the undead</i>

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.050
<i>and exchanged farewells with them.</i>

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.430
I think we've checked all 
of the major locations.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.350
I don't sense any demons.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.220
One more place...

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.210
Hey, Old Marple! You in there?

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.340
Oh?

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:25.980
That voice... It's you, Menel!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.620
This ghost appears to be 
close to the highest rank!

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:33.200
<i>Her soul must be extremely tough.</i>

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:37.060
<i>If she resists, my power 
might not be enough...</i>

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:43.260
<i>If it comes to that, I'll have to use 
a magic weapon that works on spirits.</i>

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.640
You don't need to worry so much, young man.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.610
I haven't gone senile yet.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.360
Really? Well, that's good to hear.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:58.520
It seems like you stayed behind because 
of some lingering attachment,

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:02.370
but this kid here is a genuinely 
virtuous high priest.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.380
Returning lost souls like you to 
the cycle of death and rebirth,

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:09.140
as well as treating wounded 
people, are what he does best.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:09.950
Oh?

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.600
We'll take care of the village.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.490
You can just move on already.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:20.310
Or is there something you 
still want to say to someone?

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:21.930
I'll deliver the message for—

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:22.800
Menel!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.470
You've been bad again!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.300
No, I haven't...

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.990
Where'd that come from, anyway?

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.880
Maybe you really are senile?

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:31.880
I can read you like a book!

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:33.840
What do you mean?

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.550
You're lying, that's what!

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.520
I can always tell when you're lying!

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:42.280
You're twisted, but at your core, 
you're upright and fastidious.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:48.090
All this killing and stealing isn't for you.

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:49.450
You see that now, don't you?

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.220
Shut up.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:51.130
Excuse me?

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.100
Shut up! What makes you 
think you know anything?!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.510
What was I supposed to do, then?!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.810
You died, everyone else was starving...

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.640
What else could I have done?!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.130
You think I should've prayed 
to the gods or something?!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:10.900
The gods... The gods have 
never once helped me out!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.600
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.090
Damn it! Damn it!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.410
Damn it all...

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.500
I've had enough!

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:34.510
Just let me die with you!

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:40.590
The life of a half-elf is too long for me.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:46.350
<i>Those with elven blood live 
for hundreds of years.</i>

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:50.730
Episode 7 
Traumatic Memory

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:51.270
<i>Even after they lose the 
people and places they love,</i>

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:53.230
<i>it still doesn't end.</i>

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.860
Listen to me, Menel.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.700
Meneldor!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:02.190
Despite all that, the gods have 
given you a second chance.

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.060
It is your <i>last</i> chance.

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:06.740
Stop living like some useless bum.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.820
You may hate the gods,

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:13.490
but the gods will never stop loving you.

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:15.440
Even if you don't notice it,

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.450
they will always shine down on you,

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.610
never growing bored or tired of you.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.820
So all you need to do now is 
realize that light is there.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.690
Now, priest, if you don't mind...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:32.680
Yes?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.840
Would you mind looking after this poor fool?

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.600
He's not a bad boy at heart.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:42.360
So... please treat him well, won't you?

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:45.310
I will.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:49.750
And as for the demons and demon 
beasts that attacked the village...

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.330
I'm certain they weren't just strays.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.280
The stronghold where their boss 
dwells is deep in the forest,

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:59.170
and he sends his demon minions 
all over the place from there.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.850
They command demon beasts, attack people...

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:06.100
It looks like they're routing all 
their effort into some evil plot.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:09.770
Um, if I may, is your 
lingering attachment...

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:13.380
Well, I couldn't go and pass on without 
making sure someone knew this!

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:18.470
Anyway, I appreciate the offer, 
but I don't need your guidance.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.190
You see, someone's already waiting for me.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:25.060
<i>Oh... She has someone.</i>

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.860
So I'll be on my way now.

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:32.870
Menel, take care.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:37.620
So many things happen in this world 
that can never be taken back.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:42.070
So stand up and face forward. 
There are things you need to do.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:47.090
Damn it, old woman, you're too selfish!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.000
Well, so are you.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.680
My goodness. What are we 
going to do with you?

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.980
Well, I leave the rest in your hands.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.500
Of course. You can count on me.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.770
<i>The present state of this world is dark.</i>

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:25.830
<i>At the very least, in this 
area known as Beast Woods,</i>

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:30.430
<i>demons and demon beasts still run 
rampant, never fully exterminated.</i>

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.630
<i>No nation's laws reach here,</i>

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:36.230
<i>so even among humans, 
robbing and mugging are widespread.</i>

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:39.680
<i>Of course, as an outsider 
just passing through,</i>

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.230
<i>I'm not obligated to do anything.</i>

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.500
<i>I could just walk right by it.</i>

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.480
<i>But...</i>

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.800
As you travel, I pray:

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.180
bring light to the faraway darkness.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:09.130
<i>A few days later, the villagers returned.</i>

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:13.140
<i>Though they were shocked to see 
the state the village was in,</i>

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:16.070
<i>they eventually gathered up 
their remaining farm tools</i>

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:18.650
<i>and started digging holes to bury the dead,</i>

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.340
<i>and we all laid them to rest together.</i>

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.020
So...

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.990
What will you do now?

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.280
Well, just look at this.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.210
Just for tonight, 
we're throwing a bit of a party

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.830
to mark our return to the village 
and to honor our fallen.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:47.160
You're the savior who got 
our village back for us,

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.040
so we'd really like you to join us.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.230
I'd be glad to.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:05.160
Menel...

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:23.770
Hey.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.530
It's a nice view.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:29.170
<i>Looks</i> nice, anyway.

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:33.530
Those ruins are an undead nest.

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:36.730
Countless adventurers have gone in,

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:38.480
but none ever came back.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.320
I see.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.890
Okay, then, tomorrow I'll go there.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.260
Huh? Were you even listening to me?

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:48.150
Yeah. It's an undead nest, right?

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.200
If it is, I need to go and 
return them all to the cycle.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.120
I guess that's the kind of guy you are.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.970
Being around you throws me off my pace.

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.810
I thought I was a colder person than that.

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:05.830
Little late to say that after the 
way you were wailing earlier.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:06.850
You—

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:10.000
You're saying that to someone 
who's already depressed?

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:14.010
Menel, what was Marple like?

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.760
She was a weird old woman, 
like you just saw.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.140
I was born up north in Grassland,

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:24.130
in the Great Forest of Erin, 
where elves live.

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:27.590
My mother was a woman of 
insatiable curiosity.

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.800
She took off somewhere outside the forest,

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:32.860
came back pregnant with 
some stranger's child,

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.820
gave birth to me, 
and died immediately after.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.380
I grew up at a different pace 
than everyone around me,

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.070
and the thing with my mother didn't help.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:45.520
They said I was a disgrace, 
and I didn't fit in anyway,

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.550
so I ended up fleeing the forest.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.090
Of course, the world outside 
was no paradise, either.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:55.430
But luckily for me, I could use a 
bow and arrow as well as knives.

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.810
And above all, I could see fairies.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.580
When I ran into enemies 
that wanted to eat me,

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:03.080
I had the strength to kill them instead.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:08.190
If I didn't, I'd probably be whoring 
myself out in some back alley.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.330
You do have a pretty face.

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:10.900
Huh?!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.560
Uh, nothing... Please go on.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.620
Anyway, I became an adventurer

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:20.040
and made my way to Southmark, 
where there were still a lot of old ruins...

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.850
but a member of my party betrayed me

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.600
in a fight over the loot 
we found in some ruins.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:30.020
He poisoned my food, and I nearly died.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.550
I killed him with my own hands,

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.380
but all of them except me died anyway.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.170
I didn't even know where I was wandering.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.260
It was near that village 
that I finally passed out.

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:48.740
Marple was the one who 
found me and took me in.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:51.470
At the time, she wasn't that old yet,

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.430
but she was such a weird old woman.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:59.100
She lent her bed to the antisocial 
kid she'd found lying on the ground,

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:01.030
let me eat her food,

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:05.070
and even lectured me about 
living a decent life.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:09.470
A lot of people ended up at that 
village after being found by her.

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:11.680
What was she, exactly?

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.080
I have no idea.

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:17.890
Of course, she's dead now, 
so we'll never know.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.830
That happens a lot on this continent.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.910
She did take me in and look after me.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.420
That's when I started 
pretending to be a hunter.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:31.020
There are a lot of nasty creatures 
and demon beasts in this area.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.850
I was relatively useful, 
I had a place to belong...

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:38.280
and I lost it all without any warning.

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:43.080
I got all the survivors together so we 
could be the ones doing the stealing,

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:45.500
but thanks to you, we failed miserably.

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:50.340
It sucks having a longer life than 
anyone else in a place like that.

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.590
It sucks so much,

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.170
I just want to die sometimes.

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:03.300
Right then.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.190
I gotta get back on my feet soon, though.

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:06.940
Huh?

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.400
What? Done making all those faces at me?

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.740
Uh... wha... huh?!

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:16.170
There's a huge difference between your 
priest self and your normal self, huh?

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:17.750
Wh-What?!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:22.240
Will... Priest of the goddess of light...

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:24.080
I'm grateful to you.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.330
You stopped me before I could 
do something irreversible,

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:29.990
and you saved the people of the village.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.510
So...

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:36.700
I ask to receive the goddess of light's 
divine protection through you.

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:42.870
Do you accept?

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.580
I will act as the medium

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:48.000
for you to establish a bond with my goddess.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.470
I will pray for you.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.720
May the goddess of light, Gracefeel,

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:56.780
hereby love you, shine her light upon you,

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:59.310
and walk by your side in your travels.

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.510
I swear to my guardian deity

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:05.070
that I will atone for my sins and 
live my life facing forward.

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:09.770
Please shine your light upon my path.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:17.150
There'll be a lot of tough times, 
and I might want to die now and then,

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:19.040
but I'm not gonna just stay down.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:23.050
I'll get up and face forward, 
like the old woman said.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:26.190
Menel... You are strong.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:28.440
It's amazing. I admire that.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:30.610
C'mon, don't be gross.

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.480
You're the strong one.

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.310
Where the hell does your power come from?

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:37.740
W-Well... It's not that I'm strong.

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:40.000
I just had amazing teachers.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.440
Well, I'm not gonna pry.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.820
Anyway, ready to head back?

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:45.620
Yeah.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:53.810
<i>Blood, Mary...</i>

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:57.190
<i>So, um... I think, maybe...</i>

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:03.490
<i>I just might have found the first 
person I could ever call a friend.</i>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Recap Episode 
The Path Taken
